# Strict Project Rules for Bits & Tools

## 1. Brand Identity
- The platform brand name is STRICTLY "Bits & Tools" (display) and "BitsAndTools" / "bitsandtools" (code / identifiers).
- The official domain is https://www.bitsandtools.com.
- NEVER use "Toolora" in user-facing text, page titles, OpenGraph, metadata, sample code, docstrings, or schemas.

## 2. Privacy & Architecture
- 100% client-side browser execution (zero server uploads, zero external telemetry).
- Apple HIG design system (#fbfbfd canvas, rounded-2xl/3xl, responsive split-screens).
